+                if len(v) >= FURNITURE_MIN_PAGES and any(ch.isalpha() for ch in k)
+                  and len(k.replace("#", "").strip()) > 1}
+    # PRESENT IS COUNTED IN THE SAME BAND AS OWED. It used to be a Counter over every line of
+    # the whole file while owed counted only band lines - two different populations, so any
+    # furniture key that also occurs in body text made present > owed unconditionally.
+    # Measured on 041122: owed 29, present 125, over a file that carries the page numbers once
